cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "pareto-nbd-extension: probabilistic forecasting & calibration for buy-till-you-die models"
abstract: >-
  A Python framework for the probabilistic evaluation of Pareto/NBD and Pareto/GGG
  buy-till-you-die models using proper scoring rules (CRPS, log score), randomized-PIT
  calibration diagnostics, interval coverage, and TOST equivalence tests, with MCMC and
  robust maximum-likelihood estimation, purchase-timing and Gamma-Gamma CLV extensions,
  and a machine-learning calibration benchmark.
